        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Title:</strong> Fish Go</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description (Steam-friendly):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the relaxing world of <strong>top-down fishing</strong>! Explore a variety of islands and catch fish ranging from the simplest to legendary specimens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skillchecks without time pressure</strong> – fish at your own pace and enjoy a calm, relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character and gear progression</strong> – upgrade your rods, gain experience, and unlock new islands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice and exploration</strong> – freely decide which islands to visit; the further you go, the bigger the rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and immersive gameplay</strong> – perfect for anyone looking to unwind while fishing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE and adventure</strong> – discover rare fish, earn gold, and compete against the game’s environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience peaceful yet engaging fishing that combines <strong>simulation, RPG elements, and adventure</strong> into one personalized journey at your own pace.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Title:</strong> Fish Go</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description (Steam-friendly):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the relaxing world of <strong>top-down fishing</strong>! Explore a variety of islands and catch fish ranging from the simplest to legendary specimens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skillchecks without time pressure</strong> – fish at your own pace and enjoy a calm, relaxing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character and gear progression</strong> – upgrade your rods, gain experience, and unlock new islands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice and exploration</strong> – freely decide which islands to visit; the further you go, the bigger the rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and immersive gameplay</strong> – perfect for anyone looking to unwind while fishing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE and adventure</strong> – discover rare fish, earn gold, and compete against the game’s environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience peaceful yet engaging fishing that combines <strong>simulation, RPG elements, and adventure</strong> into one personalized journey at your own pace.</p>",
